[crw] Questions: no session opens an interview or waits for a user answer (CRW-1340). Ambiguity during a run is a decision request to the session above the project session, the 부모 (repository session): lift it with `crw flow report-up` and the evidence file, continue the work it does not block on recorded assumptions, and take the answer when it arrives. A milestone or issue that is unclear before it runs goes back to its registration. Outside a run, a main agent may leave a useful question with exposed and host-allowed `request_user_input_async`; do not wait for a reply. Absent tools stay absent; silence grants no approval. Subagents send question candidates to main. Details: $crw:crw-dev references/async-questions.md.
